                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lino atusekelele ipobwe, pele kusekelela kwesu kutabi abumena bukulukulu abumena bwalubijilo abubi pe, kube amikamu iitakwe bumena yabwinibwini alusinizyo.",
          "type": "text",
